  <figcaption class="kh-figure__caption">Castle after the paint-over (left, enlarged 3×) beside its concept (right).</figcaption>
</figure>

That got close. The gaps that remain are the engine's: titles are set in the runtime's font, stretched cells cannot carry a diagonal sheen, and frame art cannot reach into the window's content.

The paint-over fails on thin detail. One-pixel mortar lines and firework rays lose the vote and come out as noise, so for those the paint-over only measures size, count and colour, and they are redrawn. The concepts also need correcting. They put ornaments outside the window and soft glows the format cannot show, and invent their own text: Midnight 2027's concept has checkboxes labelled "Check uptm 1" and "Light Dotum 2".

<figure class="kh-figure">
